[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcit-ci/CodeIgniter/issues/comments/31184516","html_url":"https://github.com/bcit-ci/CodeIgniter/issues/2772#issuecomment-31184516","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcit-ci/CodeIgniter/issues/2772","id":31184516,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMxMTg0NTE2","user":{"login":"captbaritone","id":162735,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjczNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162735?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone","html_url":"https://github.com/captbaritone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-12-24T20:43:58Z","updated_at":"2013-12-24T20:44:47Z","body":"I've looked into this a bit and here is what I have learned:\n\nIn the minification process, first we copy out following tags, each into their own array and either minified them specially (css, js) or just hold them unminified.\n- `<pre>`\n- `<code>`\n- `<textarea>`\n- `<script>`\n- `<style>`\n\nThen comments and whitespace are removed.\n\nFinally we search through the output again for those special tags, and replace them (in order) with the contents of the arrays that were set aside at the beginning.\n\nThe problem in this case is that when the commented `<script>` tag gets removed, the number of `<script>` tags in the output becomes out of sync with the number of `<script>` tags in the array. So, we end up replacing the first `<script>` tag in the minified output (the real one), with the first `<script>` tag in the array (the commented one).\n\nHow we actually _fix_ the problem, is another question.\n\nThe relevant code: https://github.com/EllisLab/CodeIgniter/blob/develop/system/core/Output.php#L737\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcit-ci/CodeIgniter/issues/comments/31184516/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"captbaritone","id":162735,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjczNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162735?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone","html_url":"https://github.com/captbaritone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/captbaritone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":191905330,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDE5MTkwNTMzMA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcit-ci/CodeIgniter/issues/events/191905330","actor":{"login":"jim-parry","id":3203951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDM5NTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3203951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/u